The talking timer's voice lines are recorded by Rose on Toast
(https://www.instagram.com/NyxFinSharkCat/) and licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

OpenCE changed the recordings: each is filtered through an 80 Hz
high-pass, cut to one take without the silence at its ends, set to a
loudness of -14.5 LUFS ("20 seconds" -12.5 LUFS) with its peaks limited
to -1 dBFS, and coded as Opus at 24 kbit/s.
